1
00:00:00,624 --> 00:00:02,824
(Penny:)It'll be like
the weirdest Comic-Con ever.

2
00:00:05,662 --> 00:00:07,932
(Sheldon:)I know that you worked hard
to put this together.

3
00:00:07,931 --> 00:00:09,431
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry I'm ruining it.

4
00:00:09,432 --> 00:00:10,702
(Adam West:)Oh, pl...
You're not ruining it.

5
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:12,730
(Penny:)Look, at some point,
Raj will try to get everyone

6
00:00:12,736 --> 00:00:14,036
(Penny:)to do the Electric Slide.

7
00:00:14,037 --> 00:00:15,737
(Penny:)Now, that will ruin it.

8
00:00:17,507 --> 00:00:19,907
(Sheldon:)I don't think
I can go back out there.

9
00:00:20,710 --> 00:00:22,480
(Penny:)That's fine.

10
00:00:33,790 --> 00:00:36,290
(Penny:)You know, I hate that
your sister and her friends

11
00:00:36,293 --> 00:00:38,593
(Penny:)used to torture you.

12
00:00:38,595 --> 00:00:40,325
(Penny:)But what I hate even more

13
00:00:40,330 --> 00:00:43,870
(Penny:)is, if I was there,
I would have tortured you, too.

14
00:00:46,036 --> 00:00:49,006
(Sheldon:)Based on this pep talk,
I'd say you're still doing it.

15
00:00:49,005 --> 00:00:51,435
(scoffs)
My point is,

16
00:00:51,441 --> 00:00:53,411
(Penny:)there was a time I never
would've been friends

17
00:00:53,410 --> 00:00:55,610
(Penny:)with someone like you,
and now...

18
00:00:55,612 --> 00:00:57,342
(Penny:)you are one
of my favorite people.

